// 鑾峰彇鎸囧畾甯冨眬鐨勫彲瑙佺敾甯冪储寮曪紙鏂板竷灞€绱㈠紩鏂规锛?
// 馃幆 2026-04-20 鏇存柊锛氱粺涓€浣跨敤鏂板竷灞€绱㈠紩
// 甯冨眬绱㈠紩: 1=1鍒嗗睆, 2=2鍒嗗睆, 3=3鍒嗗睆, 4=4鍒嗗睆, 5=6鍒嗗睆, 7=9鍒嗗睆, 10=16鍒嗗睆,
//           11=25鍒嗗睆, 12=36鍒嗗睆, 13=49鍒嗗睆, 14-17=鐗规畩甯冨眬, 18=鑷敱甯冨眬
// 姣忕甯冨眬鐙珛绱㈠紩鑼冨洿
const getVisibleCanvasIndices = (layout) => {
  // 鏂板竷灞€绱㈠紩鍒版牸瀛愭暟閲忕殑鏄犲皠
  const layoutCellMap = {
    1: 1,   // 1鍒嗗睆
    2: 2,   // 2鍒嗗睆
    3: 3,   // 3鍒嗗睆
    4: 4,   // 4鍒嗗睆
    5: 6,   // 6鍒嗗睆
    7: 9,   // 9鍒嗗睆
    10: 16, // 16鍒嗗睆
    11: 25, // 25鍒嗗睆
    12: 36, // 36鍒嗗睆
    13: 49, // 49鍒嗗睆
    14: 2,  // 鐗规畩甯冨眬1锛?澶?灏忥級
    15: 2,  // 鐗规畩甯冨眬2锛?澶?灏忥級
    16: 2,  // 鐗规畩甯冨眬3锛?澶?灏忥級
    17: 2,  // 鐗规畩甯冨眬4锛?澶?灏忥級
    18: 1   // 鑷敱甯冨眬锛堣嚦灏?涓尯鍩燂紝鍙姩鎬佹坊鍔狅級
  };

  const count = layoutCellMap[layout];
  if (count) {
    return Array.from({ length: count }, (_, i) => i + 1);
  }
  return [1];
}

// ============================================
// 甯冨眬鍒囨崲澶勭悊
// ============================================

// 澶勭悊甯冨眬鍙樺寲
// 缁熶竴浣跨敤 window.__layoutStates 杩涜甯冨眬鐘舵€佺鐞嗭紝閬垮厤鐘舵€佷笉涓€鑷?

const handleLayoutChange = async (newLayout) => {
  try {
    console.log(`[甯冨眬鍒囨崲] handleLayoutChange 琚皟鐢? newLayout=${newLayout}, typeof=${typeof newLayout}`)

    // 馃幆 澶勭悊瀵硅薄绫诲瀷鐨勮緭鍏ワ紙鏉ヨ嚜 RenderEngineWrapper 缁勪欢锛?
    if (typeof newLayout === 'object' && newLayout !== null) {
      // 濡傛灉鏄璞★紝鎻愬彇 layoutType 灞炴€?
      if (newLayout.layoutType !== undefined) {
        console.log(`[甯冨眬鍒囨崲] 妫€娴嬪埌瀵硅薄绫诲瀷杈撳叆锛屾彁鍙?layoutType: ${newLayout.layoutType}`)
        newLayout = convertLayoutTypeToIndex(newLayout.layoutType)
      } else {
        console.error('[甯冨眬鍒囨崲] 鉂?瀵硅薄绫诲瀷杈撳叆浣嗙己灏?layoutType 灞炴€?', newLayout)
        ElMessage.error('甯冨眬鍙傛暟鏃犳晥')
        return
      }
    }

    // 鍙傛暟楠岃瘉
    if (newLayout === undefined || newLayout === null) {
      console.error('[甯冨眬鍒囨崲] 鉂?鏃犳晥鐨勫竷灞€鍙傛暟: newLayout=', newLayout)
      ElMessage.error('甯冨眬鍙傛暟鏃犳晥')
      return
    }

    // 鏍囪姝ｅ湪澶勭悊甯冨眬鍙樺寲锛岄伩鍏?watch 閲嶅澶勭悊
    isHandlingLayoutChange = true

    const oldLayout = currentLayout.value
    console.log(`[甯冨眬鍒囨崲] oldLayout=${oldLayout}, currentLayout.value=${currentLayout?.value}`)

    //  缁熶竴鐘舵€佺鐞嗭細鍖哄垎鏍囧噯甯冨眬鍜岃嚜鐢卞竷灞€锛堝繀椤诲湪if鍧楀澹版槑锛?
    const isOldFreeLayout = oldLayout === 18 || oldLayout === 'free'
    const isNewFreeLayout = newLayout === 18 || newLayout === 'free'

    // 馃幆 缁熶竴鐘舵€佺鐞嗭細浣跨敤 window.__layoutStates 淇濆瓨鏃у竷灞€鐘舵€?
    if (oldLayout !== newLayout) {
      console.log(`[甯冨眬鍒囨崲] 淇濆瓨鏃у竷灞€ ${oldLayout} 鐨勭姸鎬乣)

      // 纭繚 window.__layoutStates 瀛樺湪
      if (!window.__layoutStates) {
        window.__layoutStates = {}
      }

      // 涓烘棫甯冨眬鍒涘缓妲戒綅瀵硅薄锛堝鏋滀笉瀛樺湪锛?
      if (!window.__layoutStates[oldLayout]) {
        window.__layoutStates[oldLayout] = { slots: {}, maximizedIndex: null, freeSources: [] }
      }

      if (isOldFreeLayout) {
        // 馃幆 鑷敱甯冨眬锛氫繚瀛?canvasStore 鐨?sources 鍒?window.__layoutStates
        window.__layoutStates[oldLayout].freeSources = JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(canvasStore.sources))
        window.__layoutStates[oldLayout].maximizedIndex = maximizedIndex.value
        console.log(`[甯冨眬鍒囨崲] 宸蹭繚瀛樿嚜鐢卞竷灞€ ${oldLayout} 鐨勪俊鍙锋簮:`, canvasStore.sources.length, '涓?)
      } else {
        // 馃幆 鏍囧噯甯冨眬锛氫繚瀛樺畬鏁寸殑淇″彿婧愬璞★紙涓嶄粎浠呮槸ID锛?
        const oldSlots = {}
        Object.keys(canvasSourceMap.value).forEach(key => {
          const sourceId = canvasSourceMap.value[key]
          if (sourceId) {
            // 浠?allSources 涓幏鍙栧畬鏁寸殑淇″彿婧愬璞?
            const source = allSources.value.find(s => s.id === sourceId)
            if (source) {
              // 淇濆瓨瀹屾暣鐨勪俊鍙锋簮瀵硅薄锛屽寘鍚墍鏈夌姸鎬?
              oldSlots[key] = JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(source))
              console.log(`[甯冨眬鍒囨崲] 淇濆瓨淇″彿婧? 绱㈠紩${key} -> ${source.name} (${source.id})`)
            } else {
              // 濡傛灉鎵句笉鍒颁俊鍙锋簮瀵硅薄锛屽彧淇濆瓨ID
              oldSlots[key] = sourceId
              console.warn(`[甯冨眬鍒囨崲] 鎵句笉鍒颁俊鍙锋簮 ${sourceId}锛屽彧淇濆瓨ID`)
            }
          }
        })
        window.__layoutStates[oldLayout].slots = oldSlots
        window.__layoutStates[oldLayout].maximizedIndex = maximizedIndex.value
      }

      console.log(`[甯冨眬鍒囨崲] 宸蹭繚瀛樺竷灞€ ${oldLayout} 鐨勭姸鎬?`, window.__layoutStates[oldLayout])
    }

    // 馃幆 鍏堟竻绌?canvasSourceMap锛岄伩鍏嶆棫甯冨眬鐨勪俊鍙锋簮娈嬬暀
    if (!isNewFreeLayout) {
      canvasSourceMap.value = {}
      console.log('[甯冨眬鍒囨崲] 宸叉竻绌烘棫鍒嗗睆甯冨眬鐘舵€?)
    }

    // 鏇存柊甯冨眬
    currentLayout.value = newLayout

    // 馃幆 浠?window.__layoutStates 鍔犺浇鏂板竷灞€鐨勭姸鎬?
    // 娉ㄦ剰锛歩sNewFreeLayout 宸插湪鍓嶉潰澹版槑锛堝嚱鏁板紑澶达級

    if (window.__layoutStates && window.__layoutStates[newLayout]) {
      const layoutConfig = window.__layoutStates[newLayout]
      console.log(`[甯冨眬鍒囨崲] 浠?layoutStates 鍔犺浇鏂板竷灞€ ${newLayout} 鐨勯厤缃?`, layoutConfig)

      if (isNewFreeLayout) {
        // 馃幆 鑷敱甯冨眬锛氫粠 window.__layoutStates 鎭㈠ canvasStore 鐨?sources
        if (layoutConfig.freeSources && Array.isArray(layoutConfig.freeSources)) {
          canvasStore.sources = layoutConfig.freeSources
          console.log(`[甯冨眬鍒囨崲] 宸叉仮澶嶈嚜鐢卞竷灞€ ${newLayout} 鐨勪俊鍙锋簮:`, canvasStore.sources.length, '涓?)
        } else {
          canvasStore.clearCanvas()
        }
        // 鎭㈠鏈€澶у寲鐘舵€?
        maximizedIndex.value = layoutConfig.maximizedIndex || null
        isMaximized.value = maximizedIndex.value !== null
      } else {
        // 馃幆 鏍囧噯鍒嗗睆甯冨眬锛氫紭鍏堟仮澶嶄箣鍓嶄繚瀛樼殑閰嶇疆
        const savedSlots = layoutConfig?.slots
        const validIndices = getVisibleCanvasIndices(newLayout)
        console.log(`[甯冨眬鍒囨崲] 鏂板竷灞€鏈夋晥绱㈠紩:`, validIndices)

        // 妫€鏌ユ槸鍚︽湁淇濆瓨鐨?slots 閰嶇疆
        const hasSavedConfig = savedSlots && Object.keys(savedSlots).length > 0
        console.log(`[甯冨眬鍒囨崲] 鏂板竷灞€ ${newLayout} 鏄惁宸叉湁淇濆瓨閰嶇疆:`, hasSavedConfig)

        if (hasSavedConfig) {
          // 馃幆 鎭㈠涔嬪墠淇濆瓨鐨勫垎灞忎俊鍙锋簮閰嶇疆
          const newCanvasSourceMap = {}
          const sourcesToRestore = []

          validIndices.forEach(index => {
            const key = String(index)
            const slotData = savedSlots[key] || savedSlots[Number(index)] || savedSlots[index]

            if (slotData) {
              let sourceId = null
              let sourceObj = null

              if (typeof slotData === 'string') {
                sourceId = slotData
              } else if (typeof slotData === 'object') {
                sourceId = slotData.id
                sourceObj = slotData
              }

              if (sourceId) {
                newCanvasSourceMap[key] = sourceId
                console.log(`[甯冨眬鍒囨崲] 鎭㈠淇″彿婧? 鏍煎瓙${key} -> ${sourceId}`)

                if (sourceObj) {
                  sourcesToRestore.push(sourceObj)
                }
              }
            }
          })

          // 馃幆 纭繚淇″彿婧愬瓨鍦ㄤ簬 sourceStore
          sourcesToRestore.forEach(sourceObj => {
            const existsInStore = sourceStore.sources.some(s => s.id === sourceObj.id)
            if (!existsInStore) {
              sourceStore.addSource(sourceObj)
              console.log(`[甯冨眬鍒囨崲] 宸叉仮澶嶄俊鍙锋簮鍒?sourceStore: ${sourceObj.name}`)
            }
          })

          canvasSourceMap.value = newCanvasSourceMap
          console.log(`[甯冨眬鍒囨崲] 宸叉仮澶?${Object.keys(newCanvasSourceMap).length} 涓俊鍙锋簮鍒版柊甯冨眬`)
        } else {
          // 馃幆 棣栨鍒囨崲鍒拌甯冨眬锛氬垵濮嬪寲涓虹┖甯冨眬锛屼笉浠庨瑙堝尯鍩熷厠闅嗕俊鍙锋簮
          // 杩欐牱鐢ㄦ埛蹇呴』鏄庣‘鍦版嫋鎷戒俊鍙锋簮鍒板垎灞忔牸瀛愶紝鑰屼笉鏄嚜鍔ㄥ～鍏?
          const newCanvasSourceMap = {}

          // 鍒濆鍖栧苟淇濆瓨鍒?layoutStates
          const sourcesToSave = {}

          // 鍒濆鍖?layoutStates
          window.__layoutStates[newLayout] = {
            slots: sourcesToSave,
            maximizedIndex: null
          }

          canvasSourceMap.value = newCanvasSourceMap
          console.log(`[甯冨眬鍒囨崲] 鍒濆鍖栫┖甯冨眬 ${newLayout}锛屾湭浠庨瑙堝尯鍩熷厠闅嗕换浣曚俊鍙锋簮`)
        }

        // 鎭㈠鏈€澶у寲鐘舵€?
        maximizedIndex.value = layoutConfig.maximizedIndex || null
        isMaximized.value = maximizedIndex.value !== null
      }
    } else {
      // 馃幆 濡傛灉娌℃湁淇濆瓨鐨勯厤缃紝鍒濆鍖栨柊甯冨眬锛屼繚鎸佺┖鐘舵€?
      console.log(`[甯冨眬鍒囨崲] 鏂板竷灞€ ${newLayout} 娌℃湁淇濆瓨鐨勯厤缃紝鍒濆鍖栦负绌哄竷灞€`)

      if (isNewFreeLayout) {
        canvasStore.clearCanvas()
      } else {
        // 鍒濆鍖栦负绌哄竷灞€锛屼笉浠庨瑙堝尯鍩熷厠闅嗕换浣曚俊鍙锋簮
        const newCanvasSourceMap = {}

        // 鍒濆鍖栧苟淇濆瓨鍒?layoutStates
        const sourcesToSave = {}

        // 鍒濆鍖?layoutStates
        window.__layoutStates[newLayout] = {
          slots: sourcesToSave,
          maximizedIndex: null
        }

        canvasSourceMap.value = newCanvasSourceMap
        console.log(`[甯冨眬鍒囨崲] 鍒濆鍖栫┖甯冨眬 ${newLayout}锛屾湭鏀剧疆浠讳綍淇″彿婧恅)
      }
      maximizedIndex.value = null
      isMaximized.value = false
    }

    console.log(`[甯冨眬鍒囨崲] 鏈€缁?canvasSourceMap:`, canvasSourceMap.value)
    const displayName = getLayoutDisplayName(newLayout)
    ElMessage.success(`宸插垏鎹㈠埌 ${displayName} 鍒嗗睆甯冨眬`)
  } catch (error) {
    console.error('[甯冨眬鍒囨崲] 鍒囨崲甯冨眬澶辫触:', error)
    console.error('[甯冨眬鍒囨崲] 閿欒鍫嗘爤:', error.stack)
    try {
      console.error('[甯冨眬鍒囨崲] 褰撳墠鐘舵€?', {
        newLayout,
        currentLayout: currentLayout?.value,
        canvasSourceMap: canvasSourceMap?.value || {},
        videoPreviewsCount: videoPreviews?.value?.length || 0
      })
    } catch (logError) {
      console.error('[甯冨眬鍒囨崲] 璁板綍鐘舵€佹椂鍑洪敊:', logError)
    }
    ElMessage.error('鍒囨崲甯冨眬澶辫触: ' + (error.message || '鏈煡閿欒'))
  }
}

// 馃啎 缁熶竴娓叉煋鏋舵瀯澶勭悊鍑芥暟

// 灏嗙敾甯冩簮鍚屾鍒?allSources
const syncCanvasSourceToAllSources = (canvasIndex) => {
  const sourceId = canvasSourceMap.value[canvasIndex]
  if (!sourceId) return

  // 鍦?allSources 涓煡鎵惧苟鏇存柊婧?
  const sourceIndex = allSources.value.findIndex(s => s.id === sourceId)
  if (sourceIndex !== -1) {
    const canvasSource = allSources.value[sourceIndex]
    // 鏂版灦鏋勶細鏃犻渶鍚屾 videoSyncGroupKey锛孲yncStateReplicator 鑷姩澶勭悊
  }
}

// ============================================
// 闊抽鐩戞帶鐩稿叧鏂规硶
// ============================================

// 鍒囨崲楹﹀厠椋?
const onMicrophoneToggle = async (mic) => {
  try {
    if (typeof toggleMicrophone === 'function') {
      await toggleMicrophone(mic)
    }
    if (mic.enabled) {
      if (typeof startMicrophoneLevelMonitoring === 'function') {
        await startMicrophoneLevelMonitoring()
      }
      ElMessage.success(`宸插惎鐢? ${mic.label || '楹﹀厠椋?}`)
    } else {
      if (typeof stopMicrophoneMonitoring === 'function') {
        stopMicrophoneMonitoring()
      }
      ElMessage.info(`宸茬鐢? ${mic.label || '楹﹀厠椋?}`)
    }
  } catch (error) {
    console.error('[闊抽] 鍒囨崲楹﹀厠椋庡け璐?', error)
    mic.enabled = !mic.enabled
    ElMessage.error('鎿嶄綔澶辫触')
  }
}

// 楹﹀厠椋庨煶閲忚皟鑺?
const onMicrophoneVolumeChange = (mic) => {
  try {
    if (typeof originalOnMicrophoneVolumeChange === 'function') {
      originalOnMicrophoneVolumeChange(mic)
    }
    if (window.microphoneAudioOutput) {
      window.microphoneAudioOutput.volume = mic.volume / 100
    }
    console.log(`[闊抽] 楹﹀厠椋庨煶閲? ${mic.label || '楹﹀厠椋?} - ${mic.volume}%`)
  } catch (error) {
    console.error('[闊抽] 璋冭妭楹﹀厠椋庨煶閲忓け璐?', error)
  }
}

// 瑙嗛闊抽寮€鍏冲垏鎹?
const onVideoAudioToggle = (source) => {
  try {
    if (typeof toggleVideoAudio === 'function') {
      toggleVideoAudio(source)
    }
    if (source.audioEnabled) {
      ElMessage.success(`宸插惎鐢ㄩ煶棰? ${source.name}`)
    } else {
      ElMessage.info(`宸茬鐢ㄩ煶棰? ${source.name}`)
    }
  } catch (error) {
    console.error('[闊抽] 鍒囨崲瑙嗛闊抽澶辫触:', error)
    source.audioEnabled = !source.audioEnabled
    ElMessage.error('鎿嶄綔澶辫触')
  }
}

// 瑙嗛闊抽闊抽噺璋冭妭
const onVideoAudioVolumeChange = (source) => {
  try {
    if (typeof originalOnVideoAudioVolumeChange === 'function') {
      originalOnVideoAudioVolumeChange(source)
    }
    console.log(`[闊抽] 瑙嗛闊抽噺: ${source.name} - ${source.volume}%`)
  } catch (error) {
    console.error('[闊抽] 璋冭妭瑙嗛闊抽噺澶辫触:', error)
  }
}

// 馃幆 闊抽鐘舵€佽拷韪?- 璁板綍姣忎釜婧愬綋鍓嶆鍦ㄦ挱鏀鹃煶棰戠殑鐢诲竷绱㈠紩
const activeAudioSource = ref({}) // sourceId -> canvasIndex

// 鏇存柊淇″彿婧愮殑闊抽鐘舵€佸埌瑙嗛鍏冪礌
const updateSourceAudioState = (source) => {
  try {
    console.log(`[闊抽] 鏇存柊 ${source.name} 鐨勯煶棰戠姸鎬?`, {
      audioEnabled: source.audioEnabled,
      muted: source.muted,
      volume: source.volume
    })

    // 缁熻璇ユ簮鍦ㄧ敾甯冧腑鍑虹幇鐨勬鏁?
    const canvasOccurrences = Object.values(canvasSourceMap.value).filter(id => id === source.id).length

    // 馃幆 绗竴姝ワ細鎵惧嚭璇ユ簮鍦ㄧ敾甯冧腑鐨勬墍鏈夊疄渚?
    const sourceCanvasIndices = []
    for (let canvasIndex = 1; canvasIndex <= Object.keys(canvasSourceMap.value).length; canvasIndex++) {
      if (canvasSourceMap.value[canvasIndex] === source.id) {
        sourceCanvasIndices.push(canvasIndex)
      }
    }
    // 馃幆 纭繚鏁扮粍鎸夋暟瀛楅『搴忔帓搴?
    sourceCanvasIndices.sort((a, b) => a - b)

    // 馃幆 绗簩姝ワ細鏇存柊棰勮鍖哄煙鐨勮棰戝厓绱?
    // 濡傛灉婧愬凡娣诲姞鍒扮敾甯冿紝棰勮鍖哄煙闈欓煶锛涘惁鍒欓瑙堝尯鍩熷彲浠ユ挱鏀鹃煶棰?
    // 鏌ユ壘鎵€鏈夊叿鏈夎 sourceId 鐨勮棰戝厓绱?
    const allVideos = document.querySelectorAll(`video[data-source-id="${source.id}"]`)
    console.log(`[闊抽] 鎵惧埌 ${allVideos.length} 涓棰戝厓绱?for ${source.name}`)

    // 鏇存柊 audioMixer 鐨勯煶閲?
    const audioVolume = source.audioEnabled ? (source.volume || 100) / 100 : 0
    audioMixer.setVolume(source.id, audioVolume)

    if (allVideos.length > 0) {
      // 棰勮鍖哄煙鐨勮棰戯紙绗竴涓壘鍒扮殑瑙嗛锛?
      const previewVideo = allVideos[0]
      const shouldMutePreview = canvasOccurrences > 0 || !source.audioEnabled
      previewVideo.muted = shouldMutePreview
      previewVideo.volume = (source.volume || 100) / 100
      console.log(`[闊抽] 鉁?棰勮瑙嗛 ${source.name}: muted=${previewVideo.muted}, volume=${previewVideo.volume}, 鐢诲竷瀹炰緥鏁?${canvasOccurrences}`)
    }

    // 馃幆 绗笁姝ワ細鏇存柊鐢诲竷涓殑瑙嗛鍏冪礌 - 闊抽鍘婚噸鏍稿績閫昏緫
    if (sourceCanvasIndices.length === 0) {
      // 璇ユ簮鏈坊鍔犲埌鐢诲竷锛屾棤闇€澶勭悊
      return
    }

    // 纭畾鍝釜瀹炰緥搴旇鎾斁闊抽锛堜紭鍏堜娇鐢ㄤ箣鍓嶆縺娲荤殑瀹炰緥锛屽惁鍒欎娇鐢ㄧ涓€涓級
    const previousActiveIndex = activeAudioSource.value[source.id]
    let shouldPlayAudioIndex = sourceCanvasIndices.includes(previousActiveIndex)
      ? previousActiveIndex
      : sourceCanvasIndices[0]

    // 鏇存柊娲昏穬闊抽婧愯褰?
    activeAudioSource.value[source.id] = shouldPlayAudioIndex

    // 馃幆 淇锛氫娇鐢?allVideos 鏁扮粍澶勭悊鐢诲竷涓殑瑙嗛锛堣烦杩囩涓€涓紝鍥犱负绗竴涓槸棰勮鍖哄煙鐨勶級
    const canvasVideos = allVideos.length > 1 ? Array.from(allVideos).slice(1) : []

    // 閬嶅巻鎵€鏈夌敾甯冨疄渚嬶紝璁剧疆姝ｇ‘鐨勯潤闊崇姸鎬?
    sourceCanvasIndices.forEach((canvasIndex, index) => {
      // 浠?canvasVideos 鏁扮粍涓幏鍙栧搴旂殑瑙嗛鍏冪礌
      const canvasVideo = canvasVideos[index]

      if (canvasVideo) {
        // 鍒ゆ柇鏄惁涓哄簲璇ユ挱鏀鹃煶棰戠殑瀹炰緥
        const isAudioInstance = canvasIndex === shouldPlayAudioIndex
        const shouldMute = !source.audioEnabled || !isAudioInstance

        canvasVideo.muted = shouldMute
        canvasVideo.volume = (source.volume || 100) / 100

        console.log(`[闊抽] 鉁?鐢诲竷 ${canvasIndex} 瑙嗛 ${source.name}: muted=${canvasVideo.muted}, volume=${canvasVideo.volume}, 闊抽瀹炰緥=${isAudioInstance}`)
      } else {
        console.log(`[闊抽] 鈿狅笍 鏃犳硶鎵惧埌鐢诲竷 ${canvasIndex} 涓殑瑙嗛鍏冪礌: ${source.name}`)
      }
    })

  } catch (error) {
    console.error('[闊抽] 鏇存柊闊抽鐘舵€佸け璐?', error)
  }
}

// 馃幆 鍏ㄥ眬闊抽妫€鏌?- 纭繚鎵€鏈夎棰戞簮鐨勯煶棰戠姸鎬佹纭?
const checkAllAudioStates = () => {
  try {
    console.log('[闊抽] 鎵ц鍏ㄥ眬闊抽妫€鏌?)

    // 鑾峰彇鎵€鏈夌嫭鐗圭殑瑙嗛婧愶紙鍚屾椂浠?sourceStore 鍜?mediaStore 鑾峰彇锛?
    const uniqueSources = new Set()
    Object.values(canvasSourceMap.value).forEach(sourceId => {
      // 鍏堜粠 mediaStore 鏌ユ壘锛堟湰鍦拌棰戞簮锛?
      const mediaSource = mediaStore.sources.get(sourceId)
      if (mediaSource) {
        uniqueSources.add(mediaSource)
      } else {
        // 鍐嶄粠 sourceStore 鏌ユ壘锛堝叾浠栫被鍨嬫簮锛?
        const source = sourceStore.sources.find(s => s.id === sourceId)
        if (source) {
          uniqueSources.add(source)
        }
      }
    })

    // 瀵规瘡涓簮鎵ц闊抽鐘舵€佹洿鏂?
    uniqueSources.forEach(source => {
      updateSourceAudioState(source)
    })

    console.log('[闊抽] 鍏ㄥ眬闊抽妫€鏌ュ畬鎴?)
  } catch (error) {
    console.error('[闊抽] 鍏ㄥ眬闊抽妫€鏌ュけ璐?', error)
  }
}

// 馃幆 褰撶敾甯冩簮鍙戠敓鍙樺寲鏃讹紝鑷姩妫€鏌ラ煶棰戠姸鎬?
const handleCanvasSourceChange = () => {
  // 寤惰繜鎵ц锛岀‘淇滵OM宸叉洿鏂?
  setTimeout(checkAllAudioStates, 100)
}

// 澶勭悊鏈湴瑙嗛闊抽鍙樺寲锛堜粠闊抽闈㈡澘锛?
const handleLocalVideoAudioChange = ({ enabled, volume, sourceId }) => {
  try {
    console.log('[闊抽闈㈡澘] 鏈湴瑙嗛闊抽鍙樺寲:', { enabled, volume, sourceId })

    if (sourceId) {
      // 鏇存柊鎸囧畾婧愮殑闊抽鐘舵€?
      const source = sourceStore.sources.find(s => s.id === sourceId)
      if (source) {
        // 馃幆 浣跨敤 sourceStore.updateSource 纭繚鍝嶅簲寮忔洿鏂?
        sourceStore.updateSource(sourceId, { audioEnabled: enabled, volume })
        // 鑾峰彇鏇存柊鍚庣殑婧愬璞?
        const updatedSource = sourceStore.sources.find(s => s.id === sourceId)
        if (updatedSource) {
          updateSourceAudioState(updatedSource)
        }
      }
    } else {
      // 鏇存柊鎵€鏈夋湰鍦拌棰戞簮鐨勯煶棰戠姸鎬?
      sourceStore.sources.forEach(source => {
        if (source.type === 'localVideo' || source.type === 'local-file') {
          sourceStore.updateSource(source.id, { audioEnabled: enabled, volume })
          const updatedSource = sourceStore.sources.find(s => s.id === source.id)
          if (updatedSource) {
            updateSourceAudioState(updatedSource)
          }
        }
      })
    }
  } catch (error) {
    console.error('[闊抽闈㈡澘] 澶勭悊鏈湴瑙嗛闊抽鍙樺寲澶辫触:', error)
  }
}

// 澶勭悊绯荤粺闊抽鍙樺寲锛堜粠闊抽闈㈡澘锛?
const handleSystemAudioChange = ({ enabled, volume }) => {
  try {
    console.log('[闊抽闈㈡澘] 绯荤粺闊抽鍙樺寲:', { enabled, volume })

    // 鏇存柊鎵€鏈夐潪楹﹀厠椋庢簮鐨勯煶棰戠姸鎬?
    sourceStore.sources.forEach(source => {
      if (source.type !== 'microphone') {
        source.audioEnabled = enabled
        source.volume = volume
        updateSourceAudioState(source)
      }
    })
  } catch (error) {
    console.error('[闊抽闈㈡澘] 澶勭悊绯荤粺闊抽鍙樺寲澶辫触:', error)
  }
}

